       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRPTR.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 OUT-LINE PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
       01 PTR PIC 99 VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           STRING "HELLO" DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  ", " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO OUT-LINE WITH POINTER PTR
           STRING "WORLD" DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO OUT-LINE WITH POINTER PTR
           DISPLAY OUT-LINE
           DISPLAY "NEXT FREE POSITION: " PTR
           STOP RUN.
